AWS 3-Tier Architecture on AWS
Project Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of a highly available and scalable 3-Tier Architecture on AWS.

Architecture Components
Web Tier: Amazon S3 Static Website Hosting
Application Tier: EC2 Instance running Node.js application
Database Tier: Amazon Aurora MySQL
Load Balancing: Application Load Balancer (ALB)
Scalability: Auto Scaling Group (ASG)
Monitoring: Amazon CloudWatch
Architecture Diagram
User
   │
   ▼
S3 Static Website
   │
   ▼
Application Load Balancer
   │
   ▼
EC2 Auto Scaling Group
   │
   ▼
Aurora MySQL Database
